  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/E9hENAd.png\" alt=\"banner1\"></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/sdob\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_64h.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"> </a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdob\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_64h.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\"> </a><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C8W2duu.png\" alt=\"datapack\"> <a href=\"https://gamejolt.com/games/sdob/953274\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/h85Hg1b.png\" alt=\"GameJolt\"> </a><a href=\"https://d4vide106.itch.io/sdob-mc\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Qz2uWJJ.png\" alt=\"Itch.io\"></a></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>🗼 巴別螺旋迷宮 🗼</strong><br>靈感來自《<em>在地下城尋求邂逅是否搞錯了什麼</em>》系列，本模組打造了一座完全還原原版風格、高度超過 300 格的巨型建築，內含 30 個充滿挑戰的層級。難得一見且飽含史詩般的冒險，是獻給最勇敢冒險者的勇氣之試煉！</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe width=\"600\" height=\"340\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8fnO7HA9wRY\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><h3>🌟 巴別螺旋迷宮的前三層 🌟</h3><ul><li>🟤 <strong>第一層：赫菲斯托斯的熔爐</strong> – 工藝之神棲身之處，充滿各式工具與隱藏秘密。</li><li>🌌 <strong>第二層：倪克斯的領域</strong> – 籠罩於永夜之中，暗影在此甦醒活躍。</li><li>🌿 <strong>第三層：得墨忒耳的花園</strong> – 蔥鬱的寧靜避風港，卻由自然之怒所守護。</li></ul></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:right\"><strong>📢 有建議或發現錯誤嗎？</strong><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/thfPJ7QAPJ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/compact/social/discord-plural_46h.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>💖 歡迎捐贈支持！</strong><br><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/checkout/InfinityWonderful?rid=0&amp;cadence=1&amp;custom=1\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/compact/donate/patreon-singular_46h.png\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a><br><em>您的支持幫助我改進並更新模組。感謝您！</em></div>\n\n* * *\n\n<div style=\"text-align:right\"><strong>🌟 模組使用規範</strong><br>歡迎將<strong>巴別螺旋迷宮</strong>收錄至模組包中或進行分享，請務必正確標註 D4vide106 的創作署名，並連結至官方來源（Modrinth、CurseForge 等）。</div>",
